{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49544","headline":"临江仙 一 · 尹鹗","name":"临江仙 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一番荷芰生池沼，槛前风送馨香。\n昔年於此伴萧娘。\n相偎伫立，牵惹叙衷肠。\n时逞笑容无限态，还如菡萏争芳。\n别来虚遣思悠扬。\n慵窥往事，金锁小兰房。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尹鹗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}